{
  "name": "ComfyStudio — demander un rendu et le télécharger",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ComfyStudio — recette simple\n\n1. Remplace `http://STUDIO:8199` par l'adresse de ton studio, dans les deux nœuds HTTP.\n2. Crée un credential **Header Auth** : *Name* `Authorization`, *Value* `Bearer cs_REMPLACER_PAR_TA_CLE_D_ACCES` — ta clé d'accès entière, créée dans la page du studio (bouton « clés d'accès »).\n3. Choisis ce credential dans les deux nœuds HTTP.\n\nAucun secret n'est dans ce fichier. Détail : docs/piloter-par-programme.md",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "6a1f0c2e-0b4d-4c1a-9e51-3d2b7c8a0001",
      "name": "À lire d'abord",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-60, -360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "6a1f0c2e-0b4d-4c1a-9e51-3d2b7c8a0002",
      "name": "Lancer à la main",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://STUDIO:8199/api/v1/rendus",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "={{ $execution.id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"demande\": \"un renard roux dans la neige au crépuscule\",\n  \"attendre\": 300\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 330000
        }
      },
      "id": "6a1f0c2e-0b4d-4c1a-9e51-3d2b7c8a0003",
      "name": "Demander le rendu",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [240, 0],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "A-CREER-DANS-N8N",
          "name": "ComfyStudio (clé d'accès)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.fichiers[0].url }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file",
              "outputPropertyName": "data"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "6a1f0c2e-0b4d-4c1a-9e51-3d2b7c8a0004",
      "name": "Télécharger le premier fichier",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [480, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "A-CREER-DANS-N8N",
          "name": "ComfyStudio (clé d'accès)"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Lancer à la main": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Demander le rendu",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Demander le rendu": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Télécharger le premier fichier",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "active": false
}
